{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632369708804539029 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632369708703679125&sectionId=632369708804539029)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggvjCkntfh9_text","label":"ggvjCkntfh9_text","default":"From a Favorite Photo to a Christmas Keepsake"},{"type":"html","id":"ggbM3amxFUd_text","label":"ggbM3amxFUd_text","default":"<p>Every family has photographs that bring back a special story. It could be a family vacation, a funny childhood moment, a Christmas celebration, or simply a photo that makes everyone smile.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Memobrick gives those photographs a new life by transforming them into personalized brick mosaics. Instead of keeping another special photo hidden among thousands of images on your phone, you can turn it into something your family can build, display, and enjoy together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-Ywx9TYLB_text","label":"gg-Ywx9TYLB_text","default":"<p><strong>Make Everyone Part of the Experience</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkODTUcQ65_text","label":"ggkODTUcQ65_text","default":"<p>One of the most enjoyable parts of building a Memobrick is that everyone can participate. Younger children can help with simple pieces, parents can work on larger sections, and grandparents can enjoy sharing stories connected to the photograph.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It does not have to be completed in one sitting either. Families can take their time and return to the project during the holiday season. This makes the building experience something to look forward to instead of something that ends as soon as the wrapping paper is thrown away.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggyr_7_x8Ko_text","label":"ggyr_7_x8Ko_text","default":"<p><strong>A Personalized Christmas Gift for Everyone</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5Md4eKz6X_text","label":"gg5Md4eKz6X_text","default":"<p>Finding a Christmas gift that works for different people can be challenging, but a meaningful photograph can make a Memobrick special for almost anyone.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Create a family photo for your parents, a childhood memory for your grandparents, a favorite vacation photo for your partner, or a fun picture with friends. For children, choose a memorable family moment or a photograph featuring their favorite people.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The flexibility of a personalized photo means the same idea can become a completely different gift depending on the person receiving it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYOMGZS7IM_text","label":"ggYOMGZS7IM_text","default":"<p><strong>Choosing the Right Photo</strong></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNCcZVnCT-_text","label":"ggNCcZVnCT-_text","default":"<p>The best photo is one that already has a story behind it. Choose an image that makes your family laugh, brings back a favorite memory, or reminds you of someone special.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the best results, use a clear photo with good lighting and recognizable faces. Smaller sizes are ideal for close up photos with fewer people, while larger sizes can accommodate group photos and more detailed scenes.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Most importantly, choose a photo that everyone will enjoy seeing come together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoN39zkcwt_label","label":"ggoN39zkcwt_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoN39zkcwt_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggoN39zkcwt_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoN39zkcwt_unavailableLabel","label":"ggoN39zkcwt_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoN39zkcwt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggoN39zkcwt_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoN39zkcwt_successMessage","label":"ggoN39zkcwt_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggoN39zkcwt_errorMessage","label":"ggoN39zkcwt_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcoRiuOidl_text","label":"ggcoRiuOidl_text","default":"<p><i>The best Christmas gifts do more than bring excitement when they are opened. They create opportunities to spend time together, share stories, laugh, and make new memories.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>This Christmas, give your family something they can create together. With Memobrick, a favorite photograph becomes a fun building experience and a personalized keepsake that can remain part of your home long after the holidays are over.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i>Because sometimes the best part of a Christmas gift is not opening it. It is the memory you create while making it together.</i></p>"}],
